{"id":"vod_md_5212","vodId":"5212","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"龙与虎","name_cn":"龙与虎","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230919-1/7a0596a7bf3708ef9b3a332b70f9fd77.jpg"},"summary":"新的学期开始了，外表凶狠但内心纯良的少年高须龙儿（间岛淳司 配音）决心利用重新分班的机会一扫往日同学对他的误解。更让他高兴的是，自己即将和暗恋了一年有余的栉枝实乃梨（堀江由衣 配音）成为同班同学。除此之外，还有多年的死党北村祐作（野岛裕史 配音）陪伴，一段崭新的高中生活展现在了龙儿的眼前。少女逢坂大河（钉宫理惠 配音）的出现吸引了龙儿的目光，并不是因为此人傲娇腹黑的别扭个性，而是因为在偶然中，龙儿发现，大河居然暗恋着自己的好友祐作。在相互坦白了暗恋对象后，龙儿和大河决定结成统一的恋爱战线，利用相互的帮助来完成各自的恋爱蓝图。但现实并没有想象的那么简单，在重重的误会和波折之中，两人似乎对对方都产生了超越友谊的情感。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-19 08:18:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/CkYAcvet/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/gQ5aCJLn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/CyAFEg7Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/INsXckeH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/1evSG8u4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/NwsRut64/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/mNMSF0B1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/UIa6NsS4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/YlQOVPJu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/iF0bkOUV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/bf4PBBe7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/asJvLBfO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/gHFJbjhG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/WSjbnYGt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/YH8bSl6h/in